      "lines": [
        "例如，语句“$x-2y-15=0$ 和 $2x+y=0$”可以写作：",
        "$\\begin{cases}x-2y-15=0,\\\\↵2x+y=0.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程组中每一个方程的解集合的交集，就是方程组的真值集",
        "合。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 方程",
        "$(x+2)(x-3)=0$",
        "和语句",
        "“$x+3=0$ 或者 $x-3=0$”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "等价，因为两个式子的积等于零，当且仅当其中至少有一个因",
        "式等于零。语句“$x+2=0$ 或 $x-3=0$”的真值集合，就是其",
        "中两个方程的解集合的并集。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "90",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "90. 根据等式的哪一条性质可以说明下列方程等价：",
        "а) $2x-5=3$ 和 $2x=8$；",
        "б) $10x=24$ 和 $x=2.4$；",
        "в) $\\frac{x-2}{5}=1$ 和 $x-2=5$；",
        "г) $\\frac{x}{3}+2=\\frac{x}{5}$ 和 $5x+30=3x$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "91",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "91. 任意写出一个和下列方程等价的方程：",
        "а) $7x-3=11$；　　б) $\\frac{x-3}{4}=5$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "92",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "92. 证明下列方程等价：",
        "а) $x+y=3$ 和 $2x+2y=6$；",
        "б) $2x+y-5=0$ 和 $y=5-2x$。"
      ]
    },
